17:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"article-intro","children":"A spa visit does not need to become another complicated plan. One well-chosen appointment, a little breathing room in your calendar, and a few practical details can be enough. Here is a simple way to arrange your visit to Slimmer You & Pamper Spa in Hamilton."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-takeaway","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"THE LITTLE TAKEAWAY"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Choose a starting point, confirm your appointment, and give yourself enough time to enjoy the visit."}]]}],[["$","section","choose-a-start",{"id":"choose-a-start","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Pick one starting point"}],[["$","p","Begin with the kind of experience you are curious about: a facial, body contouring, massage or a wellness service. You do not have to book several things to make the time meaningful. If the menu feels unfamiliar, use “Help me choose” and ask the team to explain your options.",{"children":"Begin with the kind of experience you are curious about: a facial, body contouring, massage or a wellness service. You do not have to book several things to make the time meaningful. If the menu feels unfamiliar, use “Help me choose” and ask the team to explain your options."}],["$","p","If you would like more than one service, discuss the sequence and timing with the spa. Ask whether the services are appropriate to combine and whether they can be arranged on the same day. A preferred time in the calendar does not reserve multiple treatments automatically.",{"children":"If you would like more than one service, discuss the sequence and timing with the spa. Ask whether the services are appropriate to combine and whether they can be arranged on the same day. A preferred time in the calendar does not reserve multiple treatments automatically."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","confirm-details",{"id":"confirm-details","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Confirm the details that shape your day"}],[["$","p","Before arranging the rest of your schedule, confirm the service, price and appointment length. Ask about preparation, arrival time and any cancellation terms. If you are planning with a friend, check that both appointments can be accommodated; submitting two requests does not guarantee simultaneous availability.",{"children":"Before arranging the rest of your schedule, confirm the service, price and appointment length. Ask about preparation, arrival time and any cancellation terms. If you are planning with a friend, check that both appointments can be accommodated; submitting two requests does not guarantee simultaneous availability."}],["$","p","Appointment hours are Monday–Friday, 10 a.m.–8 p.m., and weekends, 10 a.m.–5 p.m., Toronto time. The booking form explains whether times have been checked against the spa calendar. Sending a request does not reserve a slot. Call the team to confirm your appointment before travelling.",{"children":"Appointment hours are Monday–Friday, 10 a.m.–8 p.m., and weekends, 10 a.m.–5 p.m., Toronto time. The booking form explains whether times have been checked against the spa calendar. Sending a request does not reserve a slot. Call the team to confirm your appointment before travelling."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Treatment and total price confirmed",{"children":"Treatment and total price confirmed"}],["$","li","Date, start time and duration confirmed",{"children":"Date, start time and duration confirmed"}],"$L1a","$L1b"]}],"$undefined"]}],"$L1c","$L1d"],"$L1e"]}]
