1c:["$","section","getting-here",{"id":"getting-here","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Plan your route to Upper Wellington Street"}],[["$","p","You will find Slimmer You & Pamper Spa at 609 Upper Wellington Street, Hamilton, ON L9A 3P8. Use the directions link on our homepage to check your route before you leave. For parking, transit, entrance or accessibility questions, call the spa rather than relying on an assumption.",{"children":"You will find Slimmer You & Pamper Spa at 609 Upper Wellington Street, Hamilton, ON L9A 3P8. Use the directions link on our homepage to check your route before you leave. For parking, transit, entrance or accessibility questions, call the spa rather than relying on an assumption."}],["$","p","Give yourself a little flexibility around the appointment where you can. If you are running late or your plans change, telephone the spa directly. Your request reference helps identify the visit you are asking about.",{"children":"Give yourself a little flexibility around the appointment where you can. If you are running late or your plans change, telephone the spa directly. Your request reference helps identify the visit you are asking about."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1d:["$","section","how-booking-works",{"id":"how-booking-works","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Know what happens when you send a request"}],[["$","p","The calendar has three steps: choose an experience, select a preferred date and time, and enter your contact details. After a successful submission, you will see a reference number and can save the request details. No card or payment information is required.",{"children":"The calendar has three steps: choose an experience, select a preferred date and time, and enter your contact details. After a successful submission, you will see a reference number and can save the request details. No card or payment information is required."}],["$","p","The request remains pending until you confirm with the spa. Automated email and text confirmations are not currently sent. Call 365-833-0170 before visiting, and quote your reference if you have one. With the practical pieces agreed, there is one less thing to think about.",{"children":"The request remains pending until you confirm with the spa. Automated email and text confirmations are not currently sent. Call 365-833-0170 before visiting, and quote your reference if you have one. With the practical pieces agreed, there is one less thing to think about."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
